    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (2022 Measures No. 3) Act 2022</p>
      <p>No. 75, 2022</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to foreign investment and acquisitions, taxation, coronavirus and superannuation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Foreign acquisitions and takeovers penalties	3</p>
      <p>Foreign Acquisitions and Takeovers Act 1975	3</p>
      <p>Schedule 2—Data sharing to support government responses to major disasters	5</p>
      <p>National Emergency Declaration Act 2020	5</p>
